==Battleground==
*4 [[Metal One Horn]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Cosmic Cyclone]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
In addition to your anti-alien Crowd Control units, units that can perform critical attacks such as [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Catasaurus]] or [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Catornado]] should also be brought along to deal with the metal one horns.

